{"4456960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Yoinkers", "steam_appid": 4456960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/4b0e1a5c48dce5df789738513d7fe7cd.poster.avif?t=1787838041\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/4b0e1a5c48dce5df789738513d7fe7cd.webm?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/4b0e1a5c48dce5df789738513d7fe7cd.mp4?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throughout the universe, usable energy has become scarce. It is up to the Astro Yoinkers to yoink energy crystals from the cosmos to fuel their teams. Team up and fight the enemies by any means necessary to secure the crystals.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/99249c6f555560a3b7dc8e5e3d38d795.poster.avif?t=1787838041\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/99249c6f555560a3b7dc8e5e3d38d795.webm?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/99249c6f555560a3b7dc8e5e3d38d795.mp4?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipped with your Grabbitron Core System, grapple from asteroid to asteroid to get to the energy crystals before your enemy! But watch out… hazards may throw you off course.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/c4fc6c8d0ff3b812b8389c275d452e86.poster.avif?t=1787838041\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/c4fc6c8d0ff3b812b8389c275d452e86.webm?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/c4fc6c8d0ff3b812b8389c275d452e86.mp4?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything in space can be described in two words, Pure Chaos. Typical Energy Crystal Sites have items scattered around from Astro Yoinkers of the past. Use these items to help deter your foe from capturing what is rightfully yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/ce48ab0a422a4e1c3a265752b8053876.poster.avif?t=1787838041\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/ce48ab0a422a4e1c3a265752b8053876.webm?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/ce48ab0a422a4e1c3a265752b8053876.mp4?t=1787838041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch out enemy teams can yoink you and your crystals! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456960/extras/4b0e1a5c48dce5df789738513d7fe7cd.poster.avif?t=1787838041\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://sh